{title: Tera Hua}
{artist: Soham Naik}
{key: A#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#m] Fidaa hai tujhpe,        [F#] Yeh deewaana kar [G#] jayega
Yeh kuch bhi [Fm] tere liye,        [A#m] Adayein teri [F#] hai katilana
[G#] Mar jaye jo mila na [Fm] tu ise,        [A#m] Chahe tu aazama [G#] jitna mujhe
[F#] Karna hai ab to [G#] hasil tujhe,        [C#] Tera hua bas [A#m] tera hua
Dil [G#] yeh mera ohh,        [C#] Tera hua bas [A#m] tera hua
Dil [G#] yeh mera ohh,        [D#m] Tu jo [C#] kehde [G#] khwaab apne
Mujhe ik [A#m] dafaa,        [D#m] To kar bhi [C#] doon main
[G#] Khudko tere liye [A#m] fanaa,        [D#m] In saan [C#] son mein [G#] tu hi tu
Tu hi tu hai [A#m] basa,        [D#m] Meri aan [C#] khon ko [G#] ho gaya hai
Tere hi [A#m] nasha,        [G#] Meri baaton mein
[A#m] Zikar hai bas tera,        [G#] Humsafar bhi tu hai
[Fm] Tu hi hai [A#m] rasta,        [A#m] Main bhi na [G#] jaanu kaise hua
[F#] Sochu na zindagi [G#] tere bina,        [C#] Tera hua bas [A#m] tera hua
Dil [G#] yeh mera ohh,        [C#] Tera hua bas [A#m] tera hua
Dil [G#] yeh mera ohh
